  m_Text: 'A quiet grassland beneath a real sky and Moon,

    aligned with the current
    time in Tokyo.


    A meteor event begins at the top of every hour.

    Seasonal
    showers appear when active;

    otherwise sporadic meteors cross the sky.


    Relax,
    chat, sleep in VR, draw, or take photos.

    PC / Android / iOS'
